<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson wins 600 mln SKR Lebanon order.</title>
<headline>Ericsson wins 600 mln SKR Lebanon order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms company LM Ericsson AB on Tuesday announced it had won a GSM order worth 600 million crowns in Lebanon with France Telecom.  </p>
<p>Ericsson said in a statement that the order included new switching equipment and radio base stations.</p>
<p>The new equipment will be installed during 1997-98.</p>
<p>Ericsson said France Telecom was currently, with its local partner, the leading operator in the GSM-market in Lebanon.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
